Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 10{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.95,0:01:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen's Boxing Gym{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You found the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This building has the best WiFi in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.80,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come by whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Winner Boys Youth Group\NBaek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Baek Hyun-woo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he use to box?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he was good at it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's so smart, he uses his brain when boxing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.31,0:01:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He predicts his opponent's movements.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simply put, he's a living simulator.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He lures you in, then dodges your moves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He waits until you're exhausted,\Nand then he lands his punches on you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You become powerless.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He even knocked me out too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't locate you, so\NI couldn't send you the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you hire an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I called them before hopping out of my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been caught in the act,\Nso you'll be taken to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Police for the People{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mr. Yoon Eun-sung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mr. Pyeon{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been lying low at your\Nex-husband's, of all places?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rich, coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know by now, I do\Nanything I set my mind upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It was easy to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,don't turn me any more evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but here comes the real threat, so listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your doctor's diagnosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but your doctor refuses to elaborate,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm not your guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think I am a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you don't have much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't either, and that drives me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to fear either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents don't know you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you told them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. They already lost a son once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep acting this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want me to make those you love miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:04:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your position is still available.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold a press conference then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it all up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who'll save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,is me, not Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family is ruined...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,because you fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone would've been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, so stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Da-hye?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if she's doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You just tripped on a stone and fell...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,while running in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying the others shouldn't\Nknow Eun-sung was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I should know why that jerk came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do, so don't\Ntell our parents just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have night blindness,\Nso I couldn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You know I can catch mosquitoes in the dark.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, seeing in the dark is your sole talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, and it was this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The new chairman of Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's their sworn enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Yoon Eun-sung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you delete your Korean\Nnumber, email, and social media?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moving in under a fake name, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not call each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Only call if it's urgent for now.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,did you see Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's very weak-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure he's shocked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Are you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm just curious. That's all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is furious with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's going to make you pay if he finds you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so lie low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finally matured up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't a complete fool after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The person you dialed is unavailable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please leave a message after\Nthe beep. You may need to pay...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You got off work hours ago, so why are you late,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and what happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you get hit?\N- No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How badly hurt are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.39,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me talk. Hold on. Let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here. Let me check.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this red? Did you\Nget clubbed or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't beaten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't bite my tongue or get beaten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. I'm perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got some scratches and a split lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And why, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to brag,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.18,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was up against three men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't an easy fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and they...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,even carried...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,batons and other weapons when they came for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And you weren't armed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably didn't know, but\NI used to box when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take blows well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so it didn't hurt one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It just stung.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it? Which lunatic did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that land broker...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,who's on the no-fly list?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you were mobbed while tracking the scammer down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've run away if you were outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was arrested, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can turn the tables if he's proven guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If this ever happens again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,just run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.76,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a promise to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make promises...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Only married couples do that, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we're divorced, so we don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back beaten up like this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't beaten...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.29,0:13:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I tripped and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So you both fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you guys fight?\N- I wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.01,0:14:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,he used to box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He visited my gym yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He was shocked at your trophies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you play sports?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally say this now,\Nbut it wasn't easy raising him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He won every contest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and was always in the top ten in the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,after every exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know which path\Nto encourage him to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- It sounds like I'm bragging about my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He definitely took after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hyeon-tae is the one who took after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone said Hyun-woo was\Nthe odd member of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I take after my mom, so I can't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.90,0:15:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't take after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:16:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,she's beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,just like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in told me not to tell you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You had something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did I?\N- No?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you applied ointment this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I was in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- You need to apply this often.\N- But I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply ointment...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and replace the bandage often, so it won't scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:18:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rush hour right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,so I think I should wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always best to avoid traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we'd done just that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.67,0:19:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If we'd applied ointment on time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,disinfected our wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and replaced our bandages every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,would things have been different?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we'd broken up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,around the time when we had ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.81,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't gotten married,\Nwe would've cherished...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the memories, even to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There would've been no need...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to fester,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,or scars to form.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You would've met someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,who was kinder, warmer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be happily living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we'd broken up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.47,0:20:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't have known how I was doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would've known what you were up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and I probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,would've been regretful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you knew how things would end up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've made the same choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'd known then what I know now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've asked you more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How your day went.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Is there anything..."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"that's troubling you?"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I regret...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}not asking you such questions.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What time did you come home last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the chairman okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,what you mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,bring the chairman back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.39,0:22:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to marry Hae-in as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Marry her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she agree to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Intranet{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}New Personnel Appointment{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo\NRemoval from position due to malpractice{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.35,0:23:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.92,0:23:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just right for one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be shocked by the sudden announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.27,0:24:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I did somewhat see it coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"malpractice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.31,0:24:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.77,0:24:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. A personnel\Ncommittee will be scheduled soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.48,0:24:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out for yourself then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.82,0:24:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongdu-ri, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The air was fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, how could you take her there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.25,0:24:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.38,0:24:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.34,0:24:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.60,0:24:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We had no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was quite busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.35,0:24:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pyeon was arrested yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.31,0:24:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.11,0:24:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,he's also feigning ignorance right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't worry. I have a knack...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.87,0:25:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,for revealing truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.92,0:25:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.46,0:25:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do what we do best, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.67,0:25:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not. He's like Crown\NPrince Sado in that rice chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean?\N- Didn't you watch the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.15,0:25:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of firing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,they placed him in front of everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to see who's on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, is that why they put\Nhim next to the smoking room?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to see who he's close with.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:26:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.02,0:26:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd pick up my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.57,0:26:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.32,0:26:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't delete numbers\Nthat haven't been settled yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There are always those who\Nrefuse to pay the matchmaking fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.45,0:26:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I chase them to the ends of the\Nearth and make sure they suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my way of settling things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm pretty precise about my settlements.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.34,0:26:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you didn't get what you\Nwanted because you didn't earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.35,0:26:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I didn't do my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you dedicate decades of your\Nlife and slave away under this roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.27,0:26:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,or did you live abroad alone\Nfor many years like Eun-sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you worked for free, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.61,0:26:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm a bit dumbfounded...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,that you demanded to be the\NCEO after doing a few chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, you're telling me to go abroad...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,with little money.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.62,0:27:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that too harsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.87,0:27:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you be the CEO then,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but do your money's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.55,0:27:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Hong Man-dae.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.76,0:27:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.26,0:27:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.94,0:27:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Closed for Electrical Maintenance{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}There aren't many hospitals that\Nare fully staffed around the clock,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.82,0:27:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and have a VVIP room...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,covering an entire floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.45,0:27:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.16,0:27:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.54,0:27:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the VIP room\Nadministration at Hanju Hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.91,0:27:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our CEO wants to receive stem cell therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.42,0:27:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your VIP room on the 23rd floor available?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.46,0:28:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? He did what to my father?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm still looking into it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the nurse,\NSeul-hee wasn't involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung did it single-handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.39,0:28:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.60,0:28:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make them pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait. I called a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be in Seoul soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.57,0:28:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.69,0:28:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're my mom's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.57,0:28:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She tricked me that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.74,0:28:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was meaning to return this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.49,0:28:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.54,0:28:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother lent it to me that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.75,0:28:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I could wipe off what I'd spilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.80,0:28:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you spill?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why are you crying?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.89,0:28:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.27,0:28:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I almost told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.23,0:29:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, give that back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.95,0:29:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the biggest fools cry when times are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.12,0:29:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And only the average fools endure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.25,0:29:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do the wisest do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.25,0:29:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They eat meat when times are tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.55,0:29:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, have meat\Ninstead of crying like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.94,0:29:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.03,0:29:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Meat, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.99,0:29:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, this town is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.87,0:29:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Village Head{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking good, Du-gwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.51,0:30:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're seeing you off for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.52,0:30:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.77,0:30:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dying or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.44,0:30:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Park Seok-hun, the new village head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.53,0:30:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Inauguration of Park Seok-hun,\Nthe new village head{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great day today. Enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.62,0:30:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The inauguration party will take place...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,at my pork-and-rice-soup restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.50,0:30:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come by and have some.\NI promise to do well!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.42,0:30:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.25,0:30:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Park Seok-hun!\N- Park Seok-hun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.92,0:30:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Park Seok-hun!\N- Park Seok-hun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.89,0:30:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,where is Chun-sik?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.23,0:30:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We know everyone in this town.\NShould we have hired foreigners?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.53,0:31:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.82,0:31:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Seok-hun's men say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember we went drinking during\Nthe farm succession gathering?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.95,0:31:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And the receipt went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.79,0:31:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's why?\N- That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They also brought all the part-time résumés...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.69,0:31:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,from the urban-rural bazaar two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.75,0:31:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and claimed the part-timers\Nwere chosen out of favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.59,0:31:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.63,0:31:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.05,0:31:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two things that\Ndon't exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One, freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.85,0:31:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Two,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.73,0:31:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a peaceful transfer of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, Du-gwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.15,0:31:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are worldwide facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing what they all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.53,0:31:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When a new power takes over,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.19,0:31:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,they torment those closest to the previous one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.91,0:31:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.41,0:31:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.16,0:32:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be erasing all traces\Nof the previous regime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Erasing traces?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.84,0:32:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Paint more. I can still see it. Here, use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.93,0:32:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you.\N- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.51,0:32:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Village Head{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.93,0:32:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seok-hun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.02,0:32:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The pears are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.71,0:32:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.73,0:32:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What you want to erase aren't those pears.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.19,0:32:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my presence in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.19,0:32:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to erase my reputation\Nas the wisest village head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.53,0:32:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.82,0:32:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongdu-ri's new catchphrase will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Pretty Apple Village,"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.74,0:32:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so we need to draw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.37,0:32:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons of walls around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have to use this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not asking you to treat\Nus like we're still in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.21,0:32:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just treat us with some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.63,0:32:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to keep watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.97,0:32:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.32,0:33:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Inbox{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Undelivered\NDa-hye{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.10,0:33:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Where are you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.39,0:33:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm behind the tree.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.61,0:33:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Thanks, Honey. You saved me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.48,0:33:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Stay focused.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.57,0:33:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Use your poisoned darts.\N- I have none. I only have a hatchet.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.45,0:33:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I told you to upgrade your\Nweapons when you get money.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Who uses a hatchet these days?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.45,0:34:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Even a Vulcan isn't enough.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.08,0:34:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I don't have any money.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I need to hunt to get some, but\NI've been too busy to go hunting.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.71,0:34:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Look behind you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.00,0:34:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You keep getting hit\Nbecause you only look ahead.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You see, they come from\Nthe front when I look back.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.59,0:34:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Look behind you!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.22,0:34:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you angry that I'm bad at this?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}We live in a dog-eat-dog world,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.35,0:34:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so you have to be more cautious.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Friend List\NGeonumama{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.00,0:34:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.59,0:34:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Offline 2 hours, 3 minutes, 4 seconds{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.17,0:35:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.55,0:35:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,was online two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.48,0:35:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.85,0:35:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home safely, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.27,0:35:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.53,0:35:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.12,0:35:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I just met with the Sama\NMedical Center director's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.83,0:35:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Ryu Seong-gwang's\Nmistress is at their VIP room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.17,0:35:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's resting after getting her chest done...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.26,0:35:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll call you back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.06,0:35:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember you telling me you knew little...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,about legal matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.95,0:36:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,since you've been in the beauty industry\Nand matchmaking wealthy families...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.32,0:36:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,all your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- So I'm here to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're managing...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.54,0:36:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,13 unregistered branches of your spa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.25,0:36:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.09,0:36:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nitpicking over the fact\Nthat I worked harder than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.38,0:36:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you work hard, but you\Nalso dodged a hefty sum of taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.47,0:36:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, how much tax is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.06,0:36:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How much...?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.81,0:36:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.07,0:36:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Attorney Kim Yang-gi{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.07,0:36:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a celebrity in our field,\Nso I'm a bit starstruck right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.33,0:36:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're an excellent\Nmatchmaker and home-wrecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.67,0:36:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd do everything in your\Npower to split couples up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.34,0:36:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if they didn't pay you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.09,0:37:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd make false reports anonymously\Nand hire people to seduce them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I got some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all the clients...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.01,0:37:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,at our firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do\Nwith you, so why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.48,0:37:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These divorced couples...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.23,0:37:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,won't sit still if they find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.15,0:37:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all hot-tempered...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.36,0:37:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and from influential backgrounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.45,0:37:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The National Assembly,\NProsecutors' Office, the court...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.62,0:37:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.49,0:37:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This chairman...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.49,0:37:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,was a former gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.66,0:37:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, so be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.79,0:37:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.38,0:37:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on your side deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.38,0:37:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.81,0:37:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.72,0:37:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentiments don't move me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Only cash does.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.48,0:37:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.65,0:38:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They offered me a wonderful deal,\Nso I'm hesitant to refuse it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.69,0:38:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so first, let me see what you can offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.91,0:38:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.62,0:38:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.45,0:38:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a calculator?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.12,0:38:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very quick-thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you think of striking a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.92,0:38:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't compare me to an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.34,0:38:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me, right? I never\Nhesitate to get my hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.76,0:38:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit calculating unless\Nyou want to go to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.31,0:38:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking from experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.89,0:38:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you're the type those ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,hate the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoon Eun-sung is very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.75,0:39:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing on the dashcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.46,0:39:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with a list of\Nhigh-level general hospitals...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that allow security guards and\Nhave VIP rooms with private elevators,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,where you can rent out an entire floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've been looking into them.\N- So did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.89,0:39:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.93,0:39:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should search within\Nan hour's driving radius from Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.60,0:39:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.94,0:39:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Hong is critically ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.48,0:39:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Most ambulances don't have oxygen tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.57,0:39:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which means the medical team must've\Nhad to manually give him oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.59,0:39:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They could've only done that for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.99,0:39:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's plausible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that rules out five of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask around and check the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's share the list and look into it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.08,0:39:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loving this vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.26,0:39:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side wasn't friendly at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.14,0:39:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I was happy to kick you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.85,0:40:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you all been?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.48,0:40:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Ms. Kim doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.48,0:40:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.19,0:40:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mi-seon. I should just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.65,0:40:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, we're already here though.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.99,0:40:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all in there and waiting to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.53,0:40:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know what they're going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.74,0:40:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"We didn't know you were present."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.99,0:40:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"We weren't trying to hurt you. We're sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.33,0:40:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't trying to offend you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? You're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They just don't know the full story.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.51,0:40:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. We only read about how you were ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right?\N- But still, we didn't believe the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"No way. They'll probably still prosper..."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.86,0:40:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- "for another three years."\N- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.75,0:40:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- We wanted to check the facts,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and share the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.82,0:40:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.82,0:40:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at fault too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.33,0:40:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've told you I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.91,0:41:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was only listening in.\N- I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.72,0:41:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be seeing each other often,\Nso I'm glad we reconciled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.08,0:41:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.63,0:41:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.55,0:41:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only here to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been to places like Bali,\NHawaii, and Cancún way too often,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so we thought we'd visit\Nan unusual place this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.10,0:41:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Unusual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.86,0:41:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to Cancún? Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongdu-ri is unique,\Nand there's no ocean either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.53,0:41:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit uncomfortable, but\NI think this is a good experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.49,0:41:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When will I get to stay at a\Nplace like this ever again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.70,0:41:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No amount of money can buy this experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, and you're broke too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.12,0:41:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- It's true that you're poor for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.11,0:41:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Their assets are frozen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.09,0:41:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but they'll get them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.84,0:41:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but they don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.22,0:41:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,if they'll still be alive by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.22,0:42:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family owns 40 acres of\Nland that's been a green belt...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.26,0:42:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.47,0:42:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.60,0:42:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.60,0:42:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you guys all leave,\Nnow that you've reconciled?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.78,0:42:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone leave our town...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.65,0:42:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,after saying they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.16,0:42:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but what are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.70,0:42:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have a hunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,that we'll be seeing each\Nother often for a very long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.42,0:42:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go?\N- Yes, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.92,0:42:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right now?\N- Yes, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.76,0:42:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye.\N- We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.42,0:42:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.59,0:42:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.51,0:42:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.31,0:42:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.97,0:42:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Caffeine!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}June's Garden{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.19,0:42:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Please Pay in Advance{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.59,0:43:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.76,0:43:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.84,0:43:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We take orders up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.31,0:43:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Two shots of espresso.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.31,0:43:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be $3.20.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you have an affiliated card?\N- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.61,0:43:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.74,0:43:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.04,0:43:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you pay, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.83,0:43:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. I'm in dire need of some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.13,0:43:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I drink some first, then pay you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.13,0:44:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink first, pay later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.43,0:44:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,May I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.55,0:44:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but there's a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.85,0:44:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you step aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.10,0:44:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.23,0:44:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten iced Americanos,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,ten iced lattes, a container of syrup,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.11,0:44:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and another one full of ice cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.78,0:44:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay?\N- Sure. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.49,0:44:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I'd like to pay for hers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.91,0:44:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.54,0:44:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you having coffee\Nwhen you can't sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.83,0:44:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.96,0:44:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.05,0:44:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not free.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.69,0:44:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.32,0:45:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.99,0:45:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Be her mentor for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.49,0:45:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.78,0:45:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nepotism?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to me, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.00,0:45:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you speaking casually?\NI'm older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a young lady. I'm your senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.67,0:45:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.01,0:45:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.51,0:45:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even dare to step on my\Nseniors' shadows back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.89,0:45:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.72,0:45:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she a boomer, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.18,0:45:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to learn? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.64,0:45:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.56,0:45:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.44,0:45:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.76,0:45:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.77,0:45:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll only demonstrate once.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.03,0:45:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this. Then this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.99,0:45:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.41,0:45:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.58,0:45:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.87,0:45:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.63,0:46:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.09,0:46:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.63,0:46:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Korean that hard? Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.63,0:46:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.72,0:46:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Jeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.06,0:46:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should fire her. She's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- What? You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There sure was nepotism involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.82,0:46:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.99,0:46:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.46,0:46:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.51,0:46:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you want a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. Did you bring it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.47,0:46:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this is a violation\Nof the labor law, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.40,0:47:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be on a farm right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.23,0:47:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,baking pizza with organic cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.20,0:47:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.03,0:47:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.79,0:47:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you choose to\Nstay at your former in-laws'?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.29,0:47:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We were in a rush and just\Nhappened to stay here for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.71,0:47:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.46,0:47:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say I had to choose\Nbetween prison and my in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.92,0:47:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'd choose the former.\N- No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.47,0:47:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I wouldn't have to cook in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.60,0:47:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother-in-law cooks everything.\NWe had {\i1}japchae{\i0} and ribs for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.81,0:47:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you said "mother-in-law."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.10,0:47:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest. Is the divorce fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.73,0:47:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you saying?\N- If not, how could you be so affectionate?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.82,0:47:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not affectionate. You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Mr. Baek is still at work,\Neven after the humiliation he received?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.37,0:47:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What humiliation did he get?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.79,0:47:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.79,0:48:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard on my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.54,0:48:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting to be reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.71,0:48:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting to be reassigned? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Some malpractice or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.96,0:48:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll hold a personnel committee soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Malpractice?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.97,0:48:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.47,0:48:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The audit team couldn't find anything on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.97,0:48:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He received bribes from a law firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.43,0:48:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.60,0:48:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.85,0:48:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he embezzle money from labor costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.69,0:48:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He gave a rival company\Na list of our VIP customers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.44,0:48:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many more I can come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.36,0:48:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to make false accusations?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.82,0:48:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm debating which one to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but whatever it is, he'll become an ex-convict.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.09,0:48:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're coming home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.55,0:48:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.51,0:48:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I had an appointment in Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.26,0:49:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.89,0:49:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.27,0:49:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Should I tell him this?"\N- Then don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.03,0:49:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who came by last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.27,0:49:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.90,0:49:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You do? So you know\NYoon Eun-sung visited Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.07,0:49:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.03,0:49:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But why did he secretly visit\Nher in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.07,0:49:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something going on between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.99,0:49:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't snap at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.62,0:49:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't snap at you,\Nand there's nothing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.71,0:49:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely nothing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.34,0:49:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.84,0:49:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.43,0:49:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.01,0:49:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in didn't even budge\Nafter hearing about So-yeong...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.27,0:49:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.43,0:49:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.81,0:49:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.48,0:49:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.19,0:49:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job today!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.19,0:49:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.82,0:49:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's start with Natasha.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.61,0:49:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked 4000, which makes the total $280,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.82,0:50:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll give you $300.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.79,0:50:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you, you picked 70, which makes...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.50,0:50:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the total $4.90.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.08,0:50:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You owe me coffee, so you'll get 1700 in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.84,0:50:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ms. Lee Su-gyeong?\N- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.09,0:50:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good work.\N- Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.88,0:50:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ms. Park Seon-nyeo?\N- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Great job.\N- Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.07,0:50:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, here are your sleeping pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.38,0:50:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't slept so well without\Nany medication in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.25,0:51:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you drinking alone at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.17,0:51:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.63,0:51:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel gloomy, now that I've\Nstepped down from my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.22,0:51:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only the village head\Nof this tiny neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.98,0:51:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.98,0:51:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.32,0:51:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.11,0:52:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My battery is still half full at this hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,since no one has called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.53,0:52:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's picking up, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.99,0:52:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When I used to be the vice chairman,\NI almost never heard the message...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.12,0:52:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that played when you didn't pick up,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.62,0:52:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hear it every day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.26,0:52:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.63,0:52:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of our reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree with the saying that\Neven your shadow abandons you...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.81,0:52:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,in dark times.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.57,0:52:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any {\i1}makgeolli?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.20,0:52:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Father! You said Chemicals and Motors were mine.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.03,0:52:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Then break up with her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.16,0:52:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}If not, you'll never get my companies!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.79,0:52:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}No, I refuse to break up with her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.92,0:52:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}What did you say?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.25,0:52:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Never.\N- How dare you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.92,0:52:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Stop! Stop right there!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}CEO Jang and His Three Sons{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.51,0:53:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.47,0:53:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They always end it at the best parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.55,0:53:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.97,0:53:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.52,0:53:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.52,0:53:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how the rich live?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.11,0:53:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.15,0:53:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dramas make me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.40,0:53:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the writers didn't do their research properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.36,0:53:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.24,0:53:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The characters are often\Nseen grabbing their necks,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.03,0:53:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but the rich are very strict\Nabout their blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.16,0:53:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- After all, we have a live-in doctor.\N- A live-in doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.12,0:53:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They remove sodium from our diet\Nif our blood pressure rises even a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.34,0:53:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They remove it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.21,0:53:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And the houses all have\Nstairs in the livingroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.72,0:53:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. You don't all have them, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.30,0:53:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the opera house.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.89,0:53:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We all do, and we often use them to go upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.73,0:53:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but we take the elevator when\Ngoing down to protect our knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.90,0:54:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The writers need to do better research.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.41,0:54:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.80,0:54:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Are you sleeping?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.60,0:54:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hae-in, are you asleep?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.78,0:54:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.78,0:54:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you need to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.33,0:54:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Eun-sung came by yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.87,0:54:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Soo-cheol tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.12,0:55:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.54,0:55:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.25,0:55:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He just asked why I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.55,0:55:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.55,0:55:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He also told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.18,0:55:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to work again,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.93,0:55:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.06,0:55:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come home?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.39,0:55:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.52,0:55:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he move out if you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.94,0:55:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.69,0:55:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.03,0:55:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't talk in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.03,0:55:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he want to live with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.20,0:55:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You two aren't together.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.70,0:55:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither are we, but look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.41,0:55:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're different. We were...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,married.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.37,0:55:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.08,0:55:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've helped me so far,\Nand I think you've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.63,0:55:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you're waiting to be assigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.26,0:55:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.47,0:55:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.47,0:55:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it nothing when\Nthe reason is malpractice?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.72,0:55:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows on what documents\Nthey forged your signature?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.14,0:56:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Embezzlement? Something illegal?\NHe's capable of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.72,0:56:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.73,0:56:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't want to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.23,0:56:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.69,0:56:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of my own issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel uncomfortable...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.20,0:56:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're suffering uselessly because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.67,0:56:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.34,0:56:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing it for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.00,0:56:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.43,0:56:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find my own solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.46,0:57:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm taking the medication,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.67,0:57:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've been getting a lot of headaches lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.80,0:57:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been giving myself\Nthe WBC injection every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.01,0:58:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The tumor didn't seem to\Nhave grown in the latest photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.77,0:58:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.98,0:58:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.98,0:58:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.23,0:58:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.99,0:58:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.91,0:58:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in is sick, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.75,0:58:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me. She's been acting strange lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.41,0:58:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She also fainted last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's injecting herself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.29,0:58:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think something is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants it to be a secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.30,0:58:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.72,0:58:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to take care of her when I'm away,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.89,0:58:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll confide in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.23,0:58:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.24,0:58:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She has...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.91,0:59:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,a brain tumor,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.41,0:59:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it's big,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.83,0:59:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's a rare case,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.17,0:59:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so she can't get surgery right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She's monitoring it while taking medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.72,0:59:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.39,0:59:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't high.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.81,0:59:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.31,0:59:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.15,0:59:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the survival rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.58,0:59:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.45,0:59:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.25,0:59:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.29,0:59:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No one in her family knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.50,0:59:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,except for her aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.92,0:59:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even her parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.42,1:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.47,1:00:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They should still know about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.39,1:00:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.73,1:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that day when I visited,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.23,1:00:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and said I wanted to divorce her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.07,1:00:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out that day after returning to Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.62,1:00:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.78,1:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you were determined to divorce her,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then suddenly had a change of heart because...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.00,1:00:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.09,1:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,After finding out about it, I'd\Ndecided to maintain our marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.81,1:00:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.31,1:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.10,1:00:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.86,1:00:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.36,1:01:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and only pitied you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.99,1:01:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.62,1:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.62,1:01:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.50,1:01:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in found out about everything\Nyet still came here when I told her to,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.46,1:01:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so Mom,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.93,1:01:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,please take...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.14,1:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,good care of her...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.60,1:01:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,when I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.69,1:01:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.61,1:02:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.58,1:02:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.04,1:02:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I came by for some kimchi.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.87,1:02:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom is crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.67,1:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.96,1:02:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She was always against it and wanted me to quit,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.09,1:02:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that I've stepped\Ndown, she must be upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.01,1:02:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What? She said she was relieved that\Nyou were no longer the village head.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.02,1:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.68,1:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.96,1:02:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.98,1:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go. Come back later.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a feast.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.19,1:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just eat here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.40,1:03:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Hae-in to come and eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.12,1:03:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.21,1:03:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.83,1:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you? Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.58,1:03:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're going through,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you see...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.05,1:03:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you think like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.76,1:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Baek Du-gwan, used to belong to the people,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.85,1:03:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I'm all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.19,1:03:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I ever want that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.69,1:03:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.74,1:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, we're feasting for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.70,1:03:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.74,1:03:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.29,1:04:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, come and eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.38,1:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.22,1:04:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.97,1:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja left for Seoul in the\Nmorning to run some errands.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.08,1:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, it would've been\Nnice if she'd eaten with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.44,1:04:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.91,1:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where is Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.59,1:04:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen's Boxing Gym{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.67,1:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Geonumama has logged in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.97,1:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-hye.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.06,1:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Da-hye.{\c}{\i0}\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.57,1:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he playing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.57,1:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept my character because of all the items.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.55,1:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- Gosh.\N{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Let me just say one thing.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.41,1:05:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Forget it. You'll just swear at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.12,1:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Geonupapa sent a message{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.24,1:05:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.66,1:05:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}This is Geon-u's vaccination\Nrecord in English and Korean.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.37,1:05:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}He needs his second round of\NMMR vaccine and chicken pox vaccine.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.33,1:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Make sure he gets\Nthem wherever you are.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.67,1:05:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Make sure you sing\N"Baby Shark" when he gets them.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.17,1:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Baby shark, doo doo doo doo doo doo{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Baby shark, doo doo doo doo doo doo\NBaby shark{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.39,1:05:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFF00&}♫ {\i1}Mommy Shark, doo doo doo doo doo doo{\i0} ♫{\c}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}All done.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.85,1:05:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Thank you.\N- Gosh.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.19,1:05:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, Geon-u.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.82,1:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Did it hurt?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.32,1:05:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Well done.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.32,1:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He didn't even cry.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.16,1:05:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Come on.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.46,1:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Geonumama has logged out{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.37,1:06:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.62,1:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Seoul.\N- So suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.29,1:06:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Beom-ja left for Seoul.\NWhy are you all going there?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.67,1:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want the reporters to\Nsee you? We're in hiding, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.97,1:06:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I must do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.38,1:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Eun-sung visited.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.51,1:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of plans are you\Nhaving Soo-cheol keep secret?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.39,1:07:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to meet him today, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.52,1:07:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For what? Are you going to\Nbeg him to spare at least you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.27,1:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I should.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.36,1:07:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we all go down together?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.36,1:07:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.28,1:07:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you'll work for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.45,1:07:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my spot from the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.04,1:07:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you two colluded\Nso you could kick your family out,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.33,1:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and take over the company all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.84,1:07:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Think however you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.60,1:07:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.66,1:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetie, are you going to Seoul?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.41,1:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.83,1:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get any taxis here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.24,1:08:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drive you. Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.80,1:08:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.69,1:08:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.69,1:08:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.94,1:08:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.86,1:08:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere far away?\NThat's odd for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.67,1:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind must be strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.59,1:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are watering.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.85,1:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I know this is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've never kept any\Nsecrets from each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.44,1:09:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when your youngest son fled\Nto Sokcho because he couldn't forget...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.77,1:09:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,his first love, and I went there to get him?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.91,1:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can laugh about it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.79,1:09:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He was in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.95,1:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Las Vegas, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.21,1:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He went there to do drugs...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.09,1:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.50,1:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so will you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.13,1:09:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. No one will know you told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.35,1:09:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.21,1:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Hong Man-dae from Queens?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.60,1:09:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.61,1:10:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Mr. Baek know that Ms. Hong is here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.68,1:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.70,1:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, she left him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.79,1:11:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you rushing to?\N- As you know, it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.54,1:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.34,1:11:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.80,1:11:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.24,1:11:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.61,1:11:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't return because of your threats.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.61,1:11:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you won't return what was ours,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.70,1:11:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so if I can't get it back,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.87,1:11:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to share.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.30,1:11:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep your word.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.29,1:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The press conference will begin soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.91,1:12:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As we mentioned before, we\Nwon't answer any questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.80,1:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Press Conference for the Inauguration\Nof Yoon Eun-sung at Queens Group{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.31,1:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.89,1:12:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.52,1:12:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.48,1:12:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.02,1:12:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find my own solutions.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.48,1:12:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- is your solution?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.24,1:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I like things to be certain and quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.95,1:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.94,1:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure this is it?\N- I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.88,1:13:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I double-checked. I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.54,1:13:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ms. Moh Seul-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.08,1:13:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello, ma'am.\N- {\i1}Have you found him yet?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.13,1:13:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am. I searched all of Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.38,1:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's in a rural area.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.60,1:14:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.14,1:14:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you as soon as I find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.39,1:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that? I turned my back on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.95,1:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, his condition is the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.37,1:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.59,1:14:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The major economic newspapers, dailies,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.67,1:14:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,live media, and ones overseas\Nhave made additional requests,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.64,1:14:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so we're getting them in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.51,1:14:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The PR team has already handed out a guide.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.39,1:14:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can follow this guide,\Nand we'll release it...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,without an embargo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.48,1:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a teleprompter, so\Nyou can relax and read the words.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.44,1:14:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your wedding announcement?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.44,1:14:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't include that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.99,1:14:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll announce it at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.11,1:14:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.66,1:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.47,1:15:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Yoon Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.31,1:15:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pione Investment has become\NQueens' second biggest shareholder,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.69,1:15:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I became the new chairman of Queens Group...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.80,1:15:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,after holding an extraordinary general meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.24,1:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This decision was inevitable\Nsince the former chairman fell sick,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.28,1:15:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and we had to stop the fall of our stocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition, I've had a lot of\Nexperience in saving companies...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.58,1:15:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,from crises and re-stabilizing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.33,1:15:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite everything, however,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.88,1:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was tormented by groundless assumptions...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.50,1:15:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and fake accusations...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.67,1:15:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,about how I betrayed the former chairman,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.67,1:16:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,kicked out his family,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.80,1:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,stole from them, confined them,\Nand stowed them away in Southeast Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.27,1:16:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing for sure is,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.48,1:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,this was exactly what the\Nformer chairman wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.27,1:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove this and clear\Nup the misunderstandings,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.19,1:16:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to make a big announcement today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.87,1:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reappoint Ms. Hong Hae-in,\Nmy longtime friend...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.45,1:16:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and talented businesswoman, as\Nthe CEO of Queens Department Store.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.21,1:16:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,During the past three years, the store made...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.75,1:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,all-time record profits under her management.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.00,1:16:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That just shows how competent she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.17,1:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's hear from her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.19,1:16:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.78,1:17:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As Chairman Yoon just said,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.78,1:17:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he and I have been friends since college,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.24,1:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mr. Yoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.41,1:17:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mr. Yoon and I will do our best\Nto take a new leap forward{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.91,1:17:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.17,1:17:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,threatened me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.84,1:17:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He threatened to falsely\Ncharge and put Mr. Baek Hyun-woo,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.39,1:17:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my husband and former\Nlegal director, behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.77,1:17:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a recording as proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.94,1:17:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.94,1:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I can't return to my position...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.78,1:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,as the CEO of my department store,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.57,1:17:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,because...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.53,1:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.24,1:17:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that I have little time left to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Drink up! Bottoms up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.32,1:19:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Four Years Ago{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.03,1:19:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottoms up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.82,1:19:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.99,1:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is our intern, Hae-in, not drinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.58,1:19:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.45,1:19:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you I wasn't drinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.54,1:19:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then let's do a love shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.13,1:19:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.88,1:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Love shot.\N- Okay. Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.89,1:19:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Love shot.\N- Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.81,1:19:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drinking instead of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.27,1:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.82,1:19:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do the love shot with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.55,1:20:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong, why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.97,1:20:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I make you uncomfortable back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.22,1:20:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, extremely.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.18,1:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.43,1:20:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just too cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.35,1:20:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- You're too adorable when you're drunk,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.02,1:20:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but you still got drunk and acted cute...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.19,1:20:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of other women.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.70,1:20:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.89,1:20:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.95,1:20:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You make people's hearts race...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.70,1:20:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.62,1:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your special move,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.92,1:20:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't do it in front of others.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.25,1:20:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.09,1:20:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.37,1:21:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what she said.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.77,1:21:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Last Night{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.79,1:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in said I made her heart race...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.86,1:21:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,when I got drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.86,1:21:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.87,1:21:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.71,1:21:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think she still feels the same way?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.59,1:21:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Will her heart still race\Neven now if I got drunk...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.55,1:21:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and acted cute?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.68,1:21:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't have divorced you then.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.47,1:21:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does my heart race when I look at her?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.93,1:21:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- It does?\N- Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.94,1:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I get butterflies, and I'm\Nhappy when I look at her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.74,1:21:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss her when she's gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.91,1:21:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and when I look at her,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.37,1:22:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that I won't ever see her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.25,1:22:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.80,1:22:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But she doesn't want me...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.13,1:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to do anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.60,1:22:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.47,1:22:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I make her uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.81,1:22:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She must not like you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.98,1:22:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But she put this bandage on me,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.23,1:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and even applied ointment for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.52,1:22:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then does she still like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.19,1:22:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's confusing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.07,1:22:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask her.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.08,1:22:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.37,1:22:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.50,1:22:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.13,1:22:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.46,1:22:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.72,1:23:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.10,1:23:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.23,1:23:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.27,1:23:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.44,1:23:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.57,1:23:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.57,1:23:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She likes me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.45,1:23:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She likes me not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.66,1:23:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She likes me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.00,1:23:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She likes me not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.21,1:23:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.75,1:23:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.48,1:23:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.44,1:23:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not the case for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.66,1:24:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.29,1:24:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.39,1:24:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.13,1:25:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.62,1:25:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll give you anything you want...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.75,1:25:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll be with her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.46,1:25:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm happy, as long as you dry my\Nhair with the broken hair dryer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.09,1:25:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Please teach me how to box.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.68,1:25:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- Berries?\N- Shall we meet tonight?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.97,1:25:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}At night?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.01,1:25:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}He's looking for the chairman's secret fund.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.95,1:25:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'm going to find it first.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.60,1:25:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Get rid...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.69,1:25:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}of Baek Hyun-woo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.81,1:25:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I can't die yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.57,1:26:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I haven't told you yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.94,1:26:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I love you.{\i0}
